<title>USA: CrossComm hires firm to review options.</title>
<headline>CrossComm hires firm to review options.</headline>
<dateline>MARLBOROUGH, Mass. 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>CrossComm Corp, which makes high-performance networking products, said on Thursday it retained investment banking firm Montgomery Securities to assist it in reviewing strategic alternatives.</p>
<p>CrossComm Chairman Tad Witkowicz said: &quot;CrossComm has invested heavily in the development of several exciting networking technologies and products which are now available for marketing.&quot;</p>
<p>The relationship with Montgomery would help maximize the return on these investments, he said.</p>
</text>
